      "value": "Stack Trace from editor.log. World ID/Asset ID replaced.\nYou can find variety of these logs if you set as full log.\nIt is continuous of these log outputted.\n*File name may have variety.\n(Filename: C:\\buildslave\\unity\\build\\Runtime/Export/Debug.bindings.h Line: 45)\nApiFile file_12345678-9012-345-6789-01234567890c: Error: Failed to delete previous incomplete version!\nCannot delete against anything but the latest version of this file˸ 192‚ 191\nUnityEngine.DebugLogHandler:Internal_Log(LogType, String, Object)\nUnityEngine.DebugLogHandler:LogFormat(LogType, Object, String, Object[])\nUnityEngine.Logger:Log(LogType, Object)\nUnityEngine.Debug:LogError(Object)\nVRC.Core.ApiFileHelper:Error(OnFileOpError, ApiFile, String, String) (at Assets\\VRCSDK\\Dependencies\\VRChat\\Scripts\\ApiFileHelper.cs:1425)\nVRC.Core.<UploadFile>d__22:MoveNext() (at Assets\\VRCSDK\\Dependencies\\VRChat\\Scripts\\ApiFileHelper.cs:422)\nUnityEngine.SetupCoroutine:InvokeMoveNext(IEnumerator, IntPtr) (at C:\\buildslave\\unity\\build\\Runtime\\Export\\Coroutines.cs:17)",
